at peradang","zh":"致炎物质"},"example":{"t":"Zat itu bertindak sebagai peradang.","zh":"该物质起到了致炎物的作用。"}},{"w":"teradang-radang","ipa":"/təˌradaŋ-ˈradaŋ/","zh":"隐隐作痛（发炎状）","phrase":{"t":"terasa teradang-radang","zh":"感觉隐痛"},"example":{"t":"Dadanya terasa teradang-radang.","zh":"他的胸口感到隐隐作痛。"}},{"w":"peradangan akut","ipa":"/pəˈradaŋan aˈkut/","zh":"急性炎症","phrase":{"t":"peradangan akut paru","zh":"急性肺炎"},"example":{"t":"Dokter mendiagnosis peradangan akut.","zh":"医生诊断为急性炎症。"}},{"w":"peradangan kronis","ipa":"/pəˈradaŋan ˈkronis/","zh":"慢性炎症","phrase":{"t":"peradangan kronis sendi","zh":"慢性关节炎"},"example":{"t":"Ia menderita peradangan kronis.","zh":"他患有慢性炎症。"}},{"w":"antiradang","ipa":"/antiˈradaŋ/","zh":"抗炎，消炎","phrase":{"t":"obat antiradang","zh":"消炎药"},"example":{"t":"Dokter memberinya obat antiradang.","zh":"医生给了他消炎药。"}},{"w":"keperadangan","ipa":"/kəpəˈradaŋan/","zh":"发炎状态","phrase":{"t":"tanda keperadangan","zh":"发炎迹象"},"example":{"t":"Ada tanda keperadangan pada luka.","zh":"伤口上有发炎的迹象。"}},{"w":"meradang-radang","ipa":"/məˌradaŋ-ˈradaŋ/","zh":"怒气冲冲，不断发作","phrase":{"t":"amarah meradang-radang","zh":"怒火中烧"},"example":{"t":"Kemarahannya meradang-radang.","zh":"他的怒火中烧。"}},{"w":"diradang","ipa":"/diˈradaŋ/","zh":"被发炎侵袭（被动）","phrase":{"t":"diradang penyakit","zh":"被疾病侵袭"},"example":{"t":"Tubuhnya diradang penyakit.","zh":"他的身体受到疾病的侵袭。"}},{"w":"peradang paru","ipa":"/pəˈradaŋ ˈparu/","zh":"肺炎患者或致炎物","phrase":{"t":"penderita peradang paru","zh":"肺炎患者"},"example":{"t":"Rumah sakit itu merawat peradang paru.","zh":"那家医院收治肺炎患者。"}},{"w":"memeradang","ipa":"/məməˈradaŋ/","zh":"变得发炎或愤怒","phrase":{"t":"situasi memeradang","zh":"局势恶化"},"example":{"t":"Situasi politik kian memeradang.","zh":"政治局势日益恶化。"}},{"w":"memeradangkan","ipa":"/məməˈradaŋkan/","zh":"煽动，激化","phrase":{"t":"memeradangkan keadaan","zh":"激化局势"},"example":{"t":"Tindakan itu memeradangkan keadaan.","zh":"那个举动激化了局势。"}},{"w":"takteradang","ipa":"/tak.təˈradaŋ/","zh":"不可阻挡的，无法遏制的","phrase":{"t":"semangat takteradang","zh"